So while we cannot create a new node set key and overwrite the vanilla technology trees in that fashion, there is a workaround we can employ which produces a similar result.

Firstly we’ll clean out technology nodes except for all the vanilla vampire count technologies.
Then we are going to assign them all the same Indent and Tier coordinates at 0,0.
Then we’ll assign them all the custom technology we created earlier, while we delete the assigned effect from the technology effects junction table.

[[File:technology_example7.jpg|center|frameless|768x768px]]

[[File:technology_example8.jpg|center|frameless|768x768px]]


