Then, within RPFM, open the Preferences menu (through Ctrl+P, or PackFile -&gt; Preferences), and begin to set up the necessary preferences within. Target all of the folders for all installed Total War games, targeting the folder where the .exe of the game is. Underneath, in "MyMod's Folder", fill in your new folder.
[[File:Screenshot 2021-01-31 205343.png|left|thumb|710x710px|Fill in your MyMod folder here!]]






