We currently have two tables, we select those table fragments (in this case, called “AK_seahelm”) and we rename them to take priority according to this alphanumerical order:&lt;blockquote&gt;! # $ % &amp; ‘ ( ) + , – ; = @ 0-9 a-z [ ] ^ _ ` { } ~ Where “!” wins over “a”.&lt;/blockquote&gt;Usually, adding a “!” in front does it. But we also want to make clear what submod this is for. Right click&gt; Rename&gt; type ''!{x}_unitsize'', which will become “!AK_seahelm_unitsize”.

