If there are parts that are DESPERATE for heavy contouring, make another 30 to 60% opacity layer at Multiply and use a 1px brush for those. Use with care. 
Contours can make a huge difference between a flat icon and one that can blend in with vanilla ones. However, it's not going to save a subject that is a flat grey surface that ends up looking like a boulder with mascara.

