[[File:Dwf huskarls framed.png|none|thumb]]
This was also one of my first experiments with moving limbs around and pasting weapons from another screenshot so they're better visible or get you cool poses. Also an example of how snow is horrible as footing/background since it's so flat. Here I could save it with some brushing, but it's one of those things that might want replacing with another background entirely.


