AKA Recycling and You. 

For whatever reason you decide not to go for the screenshot method, and it's particularly understandable for stuff like cavalry or monsters that cooperate harder.
I'll use the example of a Knights Encarmine card that I chose to redo recently at the time of writing this, and I chose to base it off the Knights of the Black Rose cause I wanted them to have a horse ''rampant''.

