# ALWAYS use good indentations! Scopes should be easily detected.

Be smart with where exactly the term “local” is used – you’ll pick up how later on as you go and pick my brain, but for now, understand that you must ALWAYS put the keyword &lt;code&gt;local&lt;/code&gt; before a variable!

