    &lt;nowiki&gt;local mainUnitRecordContext =  campaignUnitContext:Call("UnitRecordContext")
    local main_unit_key = mainUnitRecordContext:Call("Key")&lt;/nowiki&gt;

or we could save time by chaining them together as follows:

    &lt;nowiki&gt;local main_unit_key = campaignUnitContext:Call("UnitRecordContext.Key")&lt;/nowiki&gt;

