Refer to the "animation and you" tutorial for more information about how they are structured 

[[File:Images.png|alt=|1226x1226px]]

==== How to create a new fragment (animation set) for a unit ====



Go to '''File -&gt; Create -&gt; New AnimPack(game''') and enter a name when prompted. This gives you a very basic example of how the file works. For more information I recommend looking into the existing game animpack

