It aims at trying to recreate the Kit bashing feeling you get when working with plastic models.

'''Download link''': [https://github.com/olekristianhomelien/TheAssetEditor/releases/latest https://github.com/donkeyProgramming/TheAssetEditor/releases/latest]

'''Youtube tutorials:''' https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXnf2q9fRNYlMn4XULPLKgg https://www.youtube.com/@dietrichstauffer2848/videos

