You can, however, get rid of any imposter definition in your VMDs. CA seems to have done so and who am I to say no to a chance of making the VMD more readable?

== ''Fin'' ==
That's pretty much it. It can be a bunch of work and it's a good chance to rethink and restart from scratch with new methods and ideas, instead of wasting time updating old stuff.</text>
