== ivf to ca_vp8 ==
1. Change your file's extension from .ivf to .ca_vp8.
2. Import your file to RPFM.
3. Click on your file and click Convert to CAMV.

= Voice Acting =
This section aims to cover actually getting voice acting done — scripts, casting calls, editing software, and so on.

== How should the voice sound? ==
You have conceptualised your character, and perhaps got it working in game. Now it's time to figure out what they will say and how they will say it. If they're a pirate they'll probably sound all ARrgghh-like. That's straightfoward. If they're a daemon they will they sound... demonic? But that's a little harder as you might need to learn some software to apply some effects to the voice. Seems obvious but it's important to know these details when you come to dealing with a voice actor so you can tell them how you want the voice acting to sound.

