      <comment>Created page with "Hi, my name's Casualfield, welcome to the Total War Modding community! In this short'ish tutorial, I will show you a few settings in RPFM to improve the experience of modding and allow you to start learning. I'm going to assume you've already read the Tutorial:Beginner's Guide and Tutorial:RPFM For Dummies because if you haven't, go do that first.   = Dependencies: The Foundation &amp; Importer  = [[File:Dependscf.png|thumb]] I always have the dependencies viewable as you ca..."</comment>
