&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Unit&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: The units unique key.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Additional Building Requirement&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Requires that a building must be built first for the unit to be available.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Campaign Cap&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: -1 is no cap, anything higher means only that amount will be allowed unless increased by an effect or script.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Caste&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Can cause issues if using an incorrect entry. Controls a few UI things and max stat values. Links to unit sets too.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Create Time&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Turns to recruit. Doesn't affect things like RoRs or units that replenish over time or are given via effects or scripts.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Is Naval&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: ALWAYS Uncheck

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Land Unit&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Links to a land unit, should be the same key as the main unit.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Number of Men&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Number of models per unit on Ultra unit size setting.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Multiplayer Cap&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Controlled else where pretty sure, set it to 0 or what ever.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Multiplayer Cost&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Cost in Custom Battles

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Naval Unit&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: ALWAYS wh_main_shp_transport

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Number of Ships&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Doesn't matter set it to 1

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Min Men Per Ship&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Just match number of men

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Max Men Per Ship&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Just match number of men

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Recruitment Cost&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Campaign Recruitment Cost

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Upkeep Cost&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Campaign Upkeep Cost

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Weight&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: UI thing only pretty sure, set it to most appropriate.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Source Requirement&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Leave Empty

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Special Edition Mask&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Leave Empty 

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;In Encyclopedia&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Enable if you want it to appear in the Encyclopedia

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Audio Voiceover Culture: Do not leave blank, set it to most appropriate.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Ui Unit Group Land&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: Controls the icon at the bottom of the unit card and controls various UI things like custom battle locations.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Tier&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: The Tier icon on the unit. Doesn't connect or interact with anything else.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;Is high Threat&lt;nowiki&gt;'''&lt;/nowiki&gt;: AI will focus and prioritize these units.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Porthole Cam: Controls the angle and view of the 3D Porthole, set it to most appropriate.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Mount: Does the unit have a mount? Yes? Then set it to most appropriate. No? Leave blank.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Use Hitpoints In Campaign: IDK, leave unchecked

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Porthole Composite Scene" Leave Blank unless you are having issues with mounted units/engines and then best of luck to you.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Melee Cp" Melee Combat Potential, don't leave blank or 0, set it to most appropriate, mainly for auto resolve stuff.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Missile Cp: Missile Combat Potential, don't leave blank or 0, set it to most appropriate, mainly for auto resolve stuff.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Can Siege: Allow attacking settlements without siege equipment. Adds the siege icon on the unit card.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Audio Voiceover Culture Override: Do not leave blank, set it to most appropriate.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Restrict XP in campaign: Set's the unit to rank 9 (I think) without the bonuses, used for RoR mainly.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Audio Voiceover Actor Group:  Do not leave blank, set it to most appropriate.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Food Cost: Set to 0

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Has Spoken Vo: I believe for playing voice lines when being highlighted. 

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Is Monster: Voiceover stuff set it to most appropriate.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Multiplayer Qb Cap: Cap for Quest battles

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Vo is Dragon: Voiceover stuff set it to most appropriate.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Optional Ui Element: Just leave blank

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Barrier Health: Adds barrier to the unit.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Can Be Bribed: Can unit be seduced by say N'Kari.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Point Allowance: No idea, set to 1.

&lt;nowiki&gt;*&lt;/nowiki&gt;Is Renown: Is it?

